<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is a follower of the Divine Diurganate. Followers are the cornerstone of the Divine Diurganate; regardless of their motives or past, the Church accepts all Ratkins and treats them with equal care. The Ratkin Nuns of the Church taught [PAWN_pronoun] basic survival skills, enabling [PAWN_pronoun] to use them to survive in this dangerous, precarious world. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Beliver.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是圣双尾教的一名信徒。教徒是双尾教国的基石，无论鼠鼠们怀抱怎样的目的和过去，教会都接受了她们，并平等地施以关怀。教会的修女们教会了[PAWN_pronoun]基本的生存技能，让[PAWN_pronoun]能有一技之长以在危险的边缘世界中活下去。</DD_Ratkin_Beliver.description>
  <!-- EN: Diurganate Beliver -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Beliver.title>双尾教国信徒</DD_Ratkin_Beliver.title>
  <!-- EN: Beliver -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Beliver.titleShort>双尾信徒</DD_Ratkin_Beliver.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is a Pastor of the Divine Diurganate. Unlike Nuns, Pastor do not directly interact with believers. Instead, they are responsible for maintaining and consecrating the Diurganate's massive mechanical creations, regularly praying for them, changing incense, and applying holy grease. However, [PAWN_nameDef] made a mistake during a consecration. [PAWN_pronoun] applied too much holy grease to the leg joints of a mech without using an incense burner. This non-dogmatic consecration caused the mech to slip in the hangar, crushing several Ratkins. As a result, [PAWN_pronoun] was exiled by the Diurganate. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Pastor.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是双尾教国的一名牧师。和修女不一样，双尾教国的牧师通常不直接面对信徒，而是负责维护和祝圣教廷的庞大机械造物，定期为它们祷告、更换熏香和涂抹圣油。\n\n然而，[PAWN_nameDef]在一次祝圣中犯了错误，[PAWN_pronoun]在一台机甲的腿部关节处涂抹了太多香油并且没有以香薰炉熏制，这种不符合教条的祝圣使得机甲在机库中打滑并压死了几只无辜鼠鼠，然后[PAWN_pronoun]就被教国流放了。</DD_Ratkin_Pastor.description>
  <!-- EN: Diurganate Pastor -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Pastor.title>双尾教国牧师</DD_Ratkin_Pastor.title>
  <!-- EN: Pastor -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Pastor.titleShort>双尾牧师</DD_Ratkin_Pastor.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is a pilot for the Divine Diurganate. The pilot mice undergo systematic training within the Diurganate to pilot its mechs. The mechs are filled with billowing black smoke and unbearably high temperatures, but compared to their counterparts who crawl through tunnels, [PAWN_pronoun]'s situation is much better. However, [PAWN_nameDef]'s past is not honorable. During a battle, [PAWN_possessive] mech was pierced by an armor-piercing round. When the brains and tissues of the other mice inside splattered on [PAWN_pronoun], [PAWN_nameDef] screamed and abandoned mech, becoming a deserter. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Pilot.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是双尾教国的一名机师，机师鼠鼠们经过双尾教国的系统性培训，以驾驶教国的机甲。机甲内部黑烟滚滚并且高温难耐，不过比起那些在地道中爬行的同类，[PAWN_pronoun]的处境还是好多了。\n\n但是[PAWN_nameDef]的过去并不光彩，[PAWN_pronoun]的机甲在一次战斗中被敌方用穿甲弹打穿了，当舱内其他鼠鼠的脑浆和组织溅在[PAWN_possessive]身上时，[PAWN_nameDef]尖叫着放弃了自己的机甲，成为了逃兵。</DD_Ratkin_Pilot.description>
  <!-- EN: Diurganate Pilot -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Pilot.title>双尾教国机师</DD_Ratkin_Pilot.title>
  <!-- EN: Pilot -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Pilot.titleShort>双尾机师</DD_Ratkin_Pilot.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is a nun from the Divine Diurganate. Compared to the followers of various folk religions in the Ratkin Kingdom, the followers of the Diurganate are more radical, thus [PAWN_pronoun] is different from the nuns active in other Rat Kingdoms. As the leader of the Diurganate's small group of followers, [PAWN_pronoun] always inspires nearby followers with her passionate spirit and leads them in striving for common goals—whether it's building colonies, holding prayer gatherings, or judging the unbelievers. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Sister.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是双尾教国的一名修女。比起鼠族王国的各种民间宗教信徒，圣双尾鼠的教徒更加激进，因此[PAWN_pronoun]也和活跃在其他鼠族王国的修女不一样。\n\n作为圣双尾鼠教徒小团体的领袖，[PAWN_pronoun]总是能以其饱满的情绪感染附近的教徒，并率领鼠鼠教徒们为了共同的目标而奋斗——无论是建设殖民地、聚众祷告还是审判无信者。</DD_Ratkin_Sister.description>
  <!-- EN: Diurganate Sister -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Sister.title>双尾教国修女</DD_Ratkin_Sister.title>
  <!-- EN: Sister -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Sister.titleShort>双尾修女</DD_Ratkin_Sister.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is the most fanatical follower of the Divine Diurganate. [PAWN_possessive] always practices the doctrines in [PAWN_possessive] actions, taking it upon to expel all heretics. This fanatical mad Ratkin is a problem for the church, so the church made up a reason and sent [PAWN_possessive] to this unfamiliar land. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Zealot.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是圣双尾教最狂热的信徒，[PAWN_possessive]总是在身体力行地践行教义，以驱逐一切异端为己任。这种狂热的疯子让教会都感到棘手，因此教会随便编了个理由，给[PAWN_possessive]打发到了这片陌生的土地上。</DD_Ratkin_Zealot.description>
  <!-- EN: Diurganate Zealot -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Zealot.title>双尾教国狂信徒</DD_Ratkin_Zealot.title>
  <!-- EN: Zealot -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Zealot.titleShort>狂信徒</DD_Ratkin_Zealot.titleShort>
  
</LanguageData>